{"id":463,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"少人数と多様な授業で学ぶ玉川学園","feature_description":"玉川学園の中学部・高等部は、1学年5〜8クラス、1クラス35名程度で編成され、中学部には約60名の教員を配置しています。独自のクラス名を用い、仲間との協調性や他者を尊重する姿勢を育みます。50分授業ではディスカッションやディベートなどを取り入れ、教員が学習や生活面を支援します。昼食は弁当を持参し、放課後は希望に応じてクラブ活動や特別講座に参加できます。","clubs":[{"id":9170,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9171,"name":"テニス（硬式）7～9年生","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9173,"name":"野球 6～9年生","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9175,"name":"チアダンス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9176,"name":"柔道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9177,"name":"スキー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9178,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9179,"name":"バスケットボール女子 7～9年生","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9181,"name":"バスケットボール男子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9182,"name":"弓道 7～12年生","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9183,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verif